{"title":"2022 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which of the following values is closest to zero?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/b/acb41cfacc29a0db98527b870d962801a01535bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ -1 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{5}{4} \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 1^{2} \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ -\\frac{4}{5} \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 0.9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"425\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The positive difference from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> can be measured with the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Absolute_value\" title=\"Absolute value\">absolute value</a> of the number. We can find which absolute value is the lowest:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/3/9e34354613c59fc29015d6ef93d3e41426d9e503.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|-1| = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"77\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/d/c0d3a0d40956c3e22d633c6bfbd40b8beb1581ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|\\frac{5}{4}| = |1.25| = 1.25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"148\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/3/be3c3b024e28155dbb89f066f68667232ef41359.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|1^{2}| = |1| = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"105\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/7/e27b3b73e7e785548b6c04c6cb3fda408843a32a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|-\\frac{4}{5}| = |-0.8| = 0.8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"175\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/0/0d0094373ff02359145862f66e79b3b54d04f774.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|0.9| = 0.9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"83\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>We can see that the lowest number came from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/e/14e9ffb13a229984e93ad3e352b89aef6252952b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } -\\frac{4}{5}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"84\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2022 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2022 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Ga